@startuml
title C4 Level 2 – Container View (Resources – Azure CIAM)

skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 15
  Shadowing true
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator
actor "Operations Manager" as Manager

cloud "Azure Entra CIAM\n(App Registration + User Store)" as CIAM
cloud "Microsoft Graph API\n(User Profile, Groups, Roles)" as Graph

rectangle "Port Management System" {

  rectangle "Resources API\nASP.NET Core" as API

  database "PortManagementContext\nAzure SQL" as DB
}

Operator --> CIAM : Login (OIDC)
Manager --> CIAM : Login (OIDC)

CIAM --> Operator : Tokens (JWT)
CIAM --> Manager : Tokens (JWT)

Operator --> API : HTTPS + Access Token
Manager --> API : HTTPS + Access Token

API --> CIAM : Validate token\n(JWT middleware)
API --> Graph : Reads user data\n(via MS Graph SDK)
API --> DB : EF Core CRUD

@enduml
